#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-vtkGetConstObjectMacro.md:1
msgid "vtkGetConstObjectMacro for const object getters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-vtkGetConstObjectMacro.md:3
msgid ""
"VTK now provides `vtkGetConstObjectMacro`, a new macro in `vtkSetGet.h` that "
"generates const getter methods for `vtkObject` member variables. This macro "
"complements the existing `vtkGetObjectMacro` by providing const-correct "
"access to object pointers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-vtkGetConstObjectMacro.md:8
msgid "Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-vtkGetConstObjectMacro.md:10
msgid ""
"The macro generates a virtual const method that returns a const pointer:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../release_details/9.7/add-vtkGetConstObjectMacro.md:12
msgid ""
"class vtkMyClass : public vtkObject\n"
"{\n"
"public:\n"
"  vtkSetObjectMacro(Points, vtkPoints);\n"
"  vtkGetConstObjectMacro(Points, vtkPoints);  // Generates: virtual const "
"vtkPoints* GetPoints() const\n"
"\n"
"protected:\n"
"  vtkPoints* Points = nullptr;\n"
"};\n"
msgstr ""
